 "method": "Whole local collection (no sample): No-Intro FDS and QD folders plus FDS images found in the RA NES folder. Blocks restart at the fwNES header and at every side; family order from the newest FDS Parent-Clone DAT (QD entries join the FDS family of the same name). total_MiB = compressed groups + block metadata estimate (90 bytes per block, 40 per reference).",
 "decision_en": "64 KiB blocks (one block per side) in a single 128 MiB group: 10.055 MiB in total against 33.72 MiB of ZIPs and 28.21 MiB with per-file LZMA. With one group the compressed size is about 9.9 MiB for every block size; smaller blocks only add metadata. 64 MiB groups split the platform into two groups (+3.8%). Side-aligned cuts do not change the compressed size but let headered and headerless copies of a side deduplicate.",
 "decision_zh": "64 KiB 块（每面一块），全平台一个 128 MiB 组：合计 10.055 MiB，原 ZIP 33.72 MiB，逐文件 LZMA 28.21 MiB。单组时各种块大小压缩后都约 9.9 MiB，块越小元数据越多；64 MiB 组会拆成两组（+3.8%）。按面切块不改变压缩大小，但能让有头、无头版本的同一面去重。",
